+# critique-SG: beat 6, the wall of signs (14.5.6, KS16), its arcade and back side seen from beat 7
+
+Owner SG (Phase 4 wave A). Captures: QA/captures/SG_r01 (KS16, 16th), SG_r01b (beat 6 stills), SG_r01h (KS17 + beat 7 stills),
+SG_r02 onward (this start). Severity: S1 breaks the money shot / reads as wrong at first glance; S2 visible defect a viewer
+notices; S3 detail.
+
+| ID | Sev | Beat | Description | Evidence (file, region) | Cause | Fix | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| SG-01 | S1 | 6 | INT-02 / CRIT0 #14: the wall is 5-6 smooth gradient panels with thick seams; no LED structure, no imagery, no signs | lookv2_01/KS16 whole wall | one wave on flat panels | NocScreenWave: imagery (displays, 8 slow programmes), panels / modules / LED pixels, per-panel variation, view angle; nine glyph signs | in progress (r01 -> r02) |
+| SG-02 | S2 | 6 | the near LED dots read as a coarse wire mesh (dark gaps 5:1) | SG_r01/KS16 x 0-700, y 300-1000; SG_r01b/beat06_signs_mid x 0-550 | dots resolved from 3 px, no diffuser | dots faded in 5-10 px, 15 % diffuser floor (energy kept) | fixed in tree, check r02 |
+| SG-03 | S2 | 6, 7 | shop rooms are flat white boxes, a white band along the sign base, the brightest thing in KS16 / look_back | SG_r01/KS16 y 930-1080; SG_r01h/beat07_heart_look_back y 515-550; SG_r01h/KS17 x 1490-1900, y 720-850 | ShopLight 0.45 x room gain 0.6 on WinCold / SignWhite, every bay lit | BV's NocShopfront states per bay (lit / dim / half shutter / dark / roller shutter), ShopLight 0.34 | fixed in tree, check r02 |
+| SG-04 | S2 | 6 | rooms read as floor-to-ceiling walls of pastel boxes (a library mosaic) | SG_r01b/beat06_signs_look_r x 0-1920, y 400-590 | NocShopfront shelves on the full room height (4.4-5 m rooms) | REQUEST BV: shelves below 2.3 m, plain wall + frieze above | open (BV) |
+| SG-05 | S2 | 7 | the wall from the plaza is a teal grid of flat mottled tiles with black dead-module blocks | SG_r01h/beat07_heart_look_back x 740-1670, y 0-510 | tile / mosaic programmes, dead modules 12 % of 3.3 % of the panels | new programmes with dark fields, fewer dead modules (8 % of 1.8 %) | fixed in tree, check |
+| SG-06 | S3 | 6 | isolated bright pixels on the 1-2 px slivers of the white rooms | SG_r01/KS16 (471, 950), (708, 980), (866, 1000), (1183, 1040) | rooms 10 x brighter than their frames | dimmer rooms (SG-03) | check r02 |
+| SG-07 | S3 | 6 | banding[wall_panel] 7.9 (16:10) / 11.5 (21:9) | SG_r01/KS16_signs_wall_1610, _219 | smooth gradient panels | imagery breaks the gradients; check r02 | open |
